{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24397","headline":"闲吟赠皇甫郎中亲家翁 · 白居易","name":"闲吟赠皇甫郎中亲家翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁能嗟叹光阴暮，岂复忧愁活计贫。\n忽忽不知头上事，时时犹忆眼中人。\n早爲良友非交势，晚接嘉姻不失亲。\n最喜两家婚嫁毕，一时抽得尚平身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}